{"id":"memorial_105304","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105300","label":"Call Logs · The Lift Conspiracy"},"label":"Breaking News: Everyone's Lying!","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105303","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105304_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"I've heard the United Forces of Humanity are looking for me."},{"id":"memorial_105304_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Why?"},{"id":"memorial_105304_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Because I exposed their dirtiest secrets!"},{"id":"memorial_105304_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"It all started with the Lift."},{"id":"memorial_105304_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Backed by massive funding from Missilis Industry, it was presented as humanity's gateway to space. But was it ever really about space?"},{"id":"memorial_105304_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Its true purpose may already be buried beneath V.T.C.'s control, Missilis's money, and the United Forces of Humanity's cover-up."},{"id":"memorial_105304_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Which means, nothing can be trusted!"},{"id":"memorial_105304_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Not religion. Not corporations. Not the government."},{"id":"memorial_105304_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Everyone, question everything."},{"id":"memorial_105304_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"What if everyone is lying?"},{"id":"memorial_105304_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"What if humanity's enemy is something we created, and now it's slaughtering us?"},{"id":"memorial_105304_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_53_04_description","text":"Even if I disappear, don't stop questioning. It's time to wake up!"}]}